# CQ2: Which AI practices does the Act prohibit, and which article prohibits each one?
PREFIX aiact: <https://w3id.org/aiact-poc#>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

SELECT ?practice ?label ?article ?quote
WHERE {
  ?practice a aiact:ProhibitedPractice ;
            rdfs:label ?label ;
            aiact:articleRef ?article ;
            aiact:sourceQuote ?quote .
}
ORDER BY ?article
